    "Easy mines faster, but prestiges pay fewer points; Hard mines slower and pays more. Everything that follows your income moves with it (the income part of each tap, steps, airdrops and game prizes); prices stay the same.\n\nA run's prestige points use the easiest difficulty picked since it began, so switching to Hard just before prestiging doesn't pay extra. Before your first miner, a new difficulty applies in full." : {

