    "Every Bitcoin on the line goes into your collection, and every %lld pay a coin prize. It never changes the odds of a spin.\n\nPayouts include your bet. Each spin pays its best line. Winning spins also pay coins, more for bigger wins. Over time the machine returns about %@ of the tokens bet, free spins included. Every spin is independent: a near miss doesn't make the next win more likely." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Every Bitcoin on the line goes into your collection, and every %1$lld pay a coin prize. It never changes the odds of a spin.\n\nPayouts include your bet. Each spin pays its best line. Winning spins also pay coins, more for bigger wins. Over time the machine returns about %2$@ of the tokens bet, free spins included. Every spin is independent: a near miss doesn't make the next win more likely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
