    },
    "Tap the cards you want to keep, then draw." : {

    },
    "Tap to catch it" : {

    },
    "Tapping" : {

    },
    "Tapping upgrades add a share of a second's production to every tap. Quick taps in a row build a combo, and the combo power-ups in the Shop raise how big it gets and how fast it builds." : {

    },
    "The chart adds a point every minute while you play." : {

    },
    "The classic formation: rug pullers on top, then pump bots and meme coins, marching a little faster and lower every wave. The Bear comes every fifth wave. Start at wave 1 or any wave you've reached." : {

    },
    "The classic walls: cold storage, liquidation and airdrop blocks, and the whale every fifth level. Start at level 1 or any level you've reached." : {

    },
    "The full rules for every game, locked or not. Each game also has a How to Play button of its own." : {

    },
    "The latest airdrops, newest first." : {

    },
    "The Live Activity shows your coin and balance on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island while the game is closed: what your miners earn a second, how long they keep going, and what you'll have when they stop. It updates each time you leave the game.\n\nThe Balance widget does the same on the Home Screen or the Lock Screen, its number growing as your miners earn. To add it, touch and hold an empty spot, tap Edit, then Add Widget, and pick Crypto Clicker." : {

    },
    "The multiplier doubles every %lld seconds until the market crashes. Every target pays back 97%% on average: it's luck, so bet what you can lose." : {

    },
